# The cross-repository master prompt is canonical in the private repository
# systemsomicslab/msdial-family-dev-context. It records licensed SDK install locations and private
# MSP library paths, so it must never be committed to this public repository, not even by accident.
prompts/00-msdial-family-development-master-prompt.md

# The campaign runner's local resource map (scripts/campaign/ports.py load_resources): it names where each
# private library is on this machine, so it never leaves it. Anything named *.local.json is local only.
*.local.json
